+
+# Task — Implement JSON Patch (RFC 6902)
+
+Added `applyPatch(document, patch)` to `src/index.ts` with the six operations (add, remove, replace,
+move, copy, test), reusing the JSON Pointer parsing of `resolvePointer` (refactored into `parsePointer`).
+Tests in `test/patch.test.ts` (new behaviour, written together with the code); README documents it.
